{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7Jc1NsQi9nna9HR2oUx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft, a few questions. Each answer would change what the request says:\n\n1. **Is there an open senior paralegal position, or would this create a new one?** If the group already has a senior paralegal, I'd ask for a second slot and explain why the group needs one. If not, I'd argue the group needs the role filled.\n2. **Does the managing partner know about the March deadline error?** I'd mention it either way. Showing that you caught the weakness and built a second-person check into the sheet makes a stronger case than leaving it for them to bring up. But if they already know, the wording has to fit what they've heard.\n3. **Are any of the 4 lawyers you support willing to back you?** If one would vouch for you, I can name them, and that usually counts for more than anything else in the letter.\n4. **Do you want this effective by a particular date or review cycle?** For example, year-end reviews or the next budget. A specific date makes it easier for them to act.\n5. **What's the partner's name, and is this going as an email or a formal letter?** Also tell me how you want to sign it.\n\nIf you don't know an answer, just say so and I'll write without it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":349,"cache_read_input_tokens":9548,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":349},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"267a1e03-02f8-47db-b6b9-850b8b9dc89f","uuid":"68a01a16-9c93-44b6-9494-328b22ea7c34","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:18:53.394Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7Jc1ChAdsbdaw6ZWayq"}
